Additional Notice on Intended Use:

NetSecureX is a network vulnerability scanning tool created for educational
purposes as part of an MCA final-year academic project. It is intended for
use only against systems, networks, and hosts that you own or have explicit,
documented authorization to test (e.g., a personal lab, isolated virtual
machines such as Metasploitable2, or an institution's designated test
environment).

Scanning networks or systems without proper authorization may violate
computer misuse and cybercrime laws in your jurisdiction, including but not
limited to the Information Technology Act, 2000 (India) and equivalent
legislation elsewhere. The authors and copyright holders accept no
responsibility or liability for misuse of this software.
